Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.37,0:22:31.75,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1860,520)\fad(240,240)\blur4\c&HFFFFFF&\fn@DFGPOP1-W5\frz-90\1a&H00&}心の熱を　覚えていたい
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.75,0:22:36.63,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1860,520)\fad(240,240)\blur4\c&HFFFFFF&\fn@DFGPOP1-W5\frz-90\1a&H00&}描く夢に見蕩れてる
